{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922060524_41cb5b11","chunk_index":19,"job_id":"mwjob_bb370670e7bc8936451212fd","precondition_digest":"4a6e79ad1a018b35e8d9fb9ec3e6615eae80ab09f96c3d0a0d5c5c36ea6962d6","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v9","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922060524_41cb5b11","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_01_adh"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"双盲治疗期：16周。","quote_sha256":"1a6bf3dc8239738bd27ee3d6d20238fec2fbace30770b88bcefacbe591b46e2a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_02_16w"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"esp_04_reg"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"7b5107e534b1945df0f53889ceb8ec820728aa37140ba980bc462ccfc9d5507a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"esp_05_oversight"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究 方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。","quote_sha256":"be0aa885037f29d4c56765417e6d5f1a34904c86b840244fa411fd8602be7b89","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"esp_07_train"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_01_adh","esp_02_16w","esp_04_reg","esp_05_oversight","esp_07_train"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"研究方案的依从","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的实施严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）以及其他适用的法律法规要求。在临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究方案的培训，使每个参研人员充分理解临床研究方案及其各指标的具体内涵，掌握GCP原则，统一记录方式与判断标准，并严格按照方案执行；培训在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。研究者按照本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将临床研究资料载入病例报告表，并接受申办者委派的临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查以及药品监督管理部门的检查。在为期16周的治疗期内，试验药与匹配安慰剂的用药依从性均通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。","rationale":"正文依据已确认事实（用药依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价；治疗期16周）及GCP框架下遵循方案、研究前培训和资料记录的一般要求撰写。医学作者需核对：培训组织方式与培训记录要求、病例报告表填写与数据核对流程、依从性评价的操作细则，以及监管用语与现行法规的一致性。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8fe9c2621d4f5dfb7a111c6e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922060524_41cb5b11","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"esp_03_center"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"esp_04_reg"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"7b5107e534b1945df0f53889ceb8ec820728aa37140ba980bc462ccfc9d5507a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"esp_05_oversight"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_03_center","esp_04_reg","esp_05_oversight"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究是多中心临床研究，监查工作按照GCP及相关适用法规的要求组织实施，覆盖各参与研究中心，以保障受试者的权益与安全，并确保研究数据真实、准确、完整。申办者委派临床监查员对本研究实施监查，核查研究是否按照经伦理委员会批准的方案、GCP及适用法规的要求执行。研究者及其研究团队应接受监查员的监查，提供监查所需的资料和原始记录，并对监查中发现的问题及时核实和改正。监查过程中发现方案偏离等情况的，应按照本方案的相关要求进行处理。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的多中心研究模式及GCP框架下监查的一般要求撰写。医学作者需核对：监查访视频次与形式、源数据核对范围、监查记录与问题跟踪流程、监查员与研究团队的职责划分，并确认与项目质量体系文件一致。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8fe9c2621d4f5dfb7a111c6e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922060524_41cb5b11","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"esp_04_reg"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"7b5107e534b1945df0f53889ceb8ec820728aa37140ba980bc462ccfc9d5507a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"esp_05_oversight"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_04_reg","esp_05_oversight"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"按照GCP及相关适用法规的要求，申办者委派稽查员对本研究实施稽查，评价研究的实施以及数据的记录和报告是否符合研究方案、GCP和适用法律法规的要求，以确保临床研究质量。药品监督管理部门及其他依法享有监管职权的机构可以对本次临床研究进行核查或检查。研究者及其研究团队应接受并配合申办者稽查员的稽查以及监管部门的核查或检查，按照要求提供研究相关的资料、记录和必要信息，并对稽查或核查中发现的问题及时核实和处理。","rationale":"正文依据GCP框架下稽查与监管部门核查的一般要求，以及研究者接受并配合稽查、核查的通用约定撰写。医学作者需核对：稽查启动与实施安排、核查或检查的配合流程、资料提供与保密要求、发现问题的处理与跟踪程序。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8fe9c2621d4f5dfb7a111c6e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922060524_41cb5b11","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"esp_04_reg"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","quote":"未经申办者和 EC 的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床 试验管理方面的改动。","quote_sha256":"743910b4d8b1f761043a6c77a60dfa3b62f4d8d4bc0415e5e8d1e9bd1a956b8c","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","span_id":"esp_06_dev"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"临床研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究 方案的培训，使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。","quote_sha256":"be0aa885037f29d4c56765417e6d5f1a34904c86b840244fa411fd8602be7b89","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"esp_07_train"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_04_reg","esp_06_dev","esp_07_train"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"方案偏离","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"根据GCP要求，未经申办者和伦理委员会的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案；为及时消除对受试者的紧急危害而发生的偏离，以及更换监查员、联系电话等仅涉及临床试验管理方面的改动除外。研究团队应严格按照经伦理委员会批准的方案开展各项研究活动，避免发生方案偏离，保护受试者的安全与权益，并保证研究数据的可靠性。发生方案偏离时，应按照GCP及适用法规的要求予以记录和处理；研究者及其研究团队应配合监查员对方案偏离情况进行核实。","rationale":"正文依据GCP关于未经申办者和伦理委员会同意不得修改或偏离方案、紧急情形例外的要求，以及按批准方案严格执行的一般要求撰写。医学作者需核对：方案偏离的定义与分级、记录与报告流程、对受试者安全与数据可靠性影响的评估方式、纠正与预防措施。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc","section_number":"12.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8fe9c2621d4f5dfb7a111c6e","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8fe9c2621d4f5dfb7a111c6e","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8fe9c2621d4f5dfb7a111c6e","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"6b801a21cf7c158eeaec249bf45ccd3e21fb5e609cdbac4783c92230d3db3674"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"}]}